# Live Astro site runtime routes used as prompt copy in docs/design-system/.
# Served at runtime by the Astro site; no committed .md file exists, so lychee
# --root-dir . resolves them to file:// URIs under the repo root and flags them
# as missing. Match the RESOLVED file:// form — anchored `^/showcase/$` does not
# match what lychee actually checks. They are valid runtime routes.
file://.*/showcase/?$
file://.*/concepts/?$
file://.*docs/AGENTS\.md
file://.*docs/src/architecture/.*
file://.*vox-vscode/.*
file://.*docs/theme/.*
file://.*docs/src/index\.md
file://.*docs/book\.toml
file://.*\.vox/audit/.*


